    <string name="phone_action_nothing" translatable="false">Nothing</string>
    <string name="phone_buttons_double_wait" translatable="false">With a double press set to do something, every single press of the knob waits the double-press time to see if a second one follows.</string>
    <string name="phone_buttons_hold_turn_unknown" translatable="false">Hold and turn works only if the car sends knob turns while the knob is held down. Not known yet for this car.</string>
    <string name="phone_buttons_back_double" translatable="false">Two quick presses of Back always leave an app that ignores Back, so a double press is not offered here.</string>
    <string name="phone_buttons_timing" translatable="false">Timing</string>
    <string name="phone_buttons_hold_time" translatable="false">A hold is a press longer than %1$d ms</string>
    <string name="phone_buttons_double_time" translatable="false">A double press is two presses within %1$d ms</string>
    <string name="phone_buttons_codes_unknown" translatable="false">Which signals the box sends for each button is not known until a connection log from the car. If the wheel and the knob send the same signal, they share one set of gestures.</string>
